MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ArrayAccess_TestAccess
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ArrayAccess_TestAccess [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 5 1  4
MOVE TEMP 4 4
L2 CJUMP  LE TEMP 4 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 5 1  4  1 L3
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 4 0  0
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 4 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 3 0 5
RETURN TEMP 3
END


HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0 4 10

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1 4 20

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2 4 30

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 3 4 40

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 4 4 50

MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 4
RETURN TEMP 6
END


PRINT TEMP 2

MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 7 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 4
RETURN TEMP 8
END


PRINT TEMP 2

MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 9 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 4
RETURN TEMP 10
END


PRINT TEMP 2

RETURN 0
END

